  "texts": {
    "preamble": "P.Arokia Prabhu vs The Commissioner on 27 February, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.N In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 27.02.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.4765 of 2024 P.Arokia Prabhu ... Petition -Vs- 1. The Commissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Dms Campus, Anna Salai, Chennai 600 006. 2. The Designated Officer, Salem District Food Safety Office, Salem 636 001. ... Respondents Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution of India for the issuance of a Writ of Mandamus, directing the first respondent t appropriate orders on the representations of the petitioner submitted on 03.01.2024 and 02.02.2024 for sanction of full additional charge allowan the period as mentioned in para 3 above, within a reasonable period as m fixed by this Hon'ble Court. For Petitioner : Mr.T.Ranganathan For Respondents : Mr.K.Tamilvendan Government Advocate ORDER https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
    "facts": "Subsequently, the petitioner was absorbed as Food Safety Officer in the year 2011. When the petitioner was working as Food Safety Officer in Vellore and Salem District, he was placed full additional charge of the Food Safety Officer in other blocks. Therefore, the petitioner submitted representations claiming full additional charge allowance as per Rule 49 of the Tamil Nadu Fundamental Rules, 1922. It is the further case of the petitioner that similarly placed person was given additional charge allowance as directed by this Court.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
